
@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra API
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao bai nop - 201 Created
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "DTC245200302",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/EduSubmit"
}

### 4. Doc lai bai nop - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Bai nop khong ton tai - 404 Not Found
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 6. Du lieu khong hop le - 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/EduSubmit"
}

